<section class="band" id="method">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="head">
            <span class="eyebrow">Step by step</span>
            <h2>Calm, bounded, and in your presence.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step"><h3>Before the visit</h3><p>You reach us by WhatsApp or Signal with a short, neutral message — no sensitive details yet. We confirm the fit, agree a time, and tell you what to prepare. No forms, no third-party systems. If your situation is safety-sensitive, timing and sequencing may be adjusted to keep you safe.</p></div>
            <div class="step"><h3>At the start</h3><p>We begin with your situation — what has happened, what you are worried about, and what you fear may be exposed. Together we map the accounts, devices, apps, and access points that matter, and agree what will and will not be done.</p></div>
            <div class="step"><h3>During the work</h3><p>You remain present the whole time. We explain each meaningful change in plain English before we make it. Nothing is accessed remotely, nothing is uploaded, and no log of your digital life is kept. Anything outside the agreed scope becomes a separate step or add-on — with your approval, never a surprise.</p></div>
            <div class="step"><h3>If something sensitive comes up</h3><p>We stay calm and practical. We do not investigate anyone else, reconstruct the past, or give legal advice. Where appropriate, we may suggest you speak with your attorney, a safety advisor, or another specialist — and we pause and plan rather than rushing.</p></div>
            <div class="step"><h3>At the end</h3><p>You receive a plain-English summary of what was reviewed, what changed, and what to do next. Full-package clients also receive a private dated record of the work performed, and — only if you authorize it — an attorney-friendly summary.</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

